{"text":"kuruntokai","n":136,"lines":["காமங் காமம் என்ப காமம்","அணங்கும் பிணியும் அன்றே நுணங்கிக்","கடுத்தலுந் தணிதலும் இன்றே யானை","குளகுமென் றாள்மதம் போலப்","பாணியும் உடைத்தது காணுநர்ப் பெறினே"],"tr":["kāmaṅ kāmam eṉpa kāmam","aṇaṅkum piṇiyum aṉṟē nuṇaṅkik","kaṭuttalun taṇitalum iṉṟē yāṉai","kuḷakumeṉ ṟāḷmatam pōlap","pāṇiyum uṭaittatu kāṇunarp peṟiṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"மிளைப்பெருங் கந்தனார்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Miḷaipperuṅ Kantaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 9"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"காமங்","tr":"kāmaṅ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மங்","tr":"maṅ"}]},{"text":"காமம்","tr":"kāmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]},{"text":"என்ப","tr":"eṉpa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"என்","tr":"eṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]},{"text":"காமம்","tr":"kāmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]}],[{"text":"அணங்கும்","tr":"aṇaṅkum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அணங்","tr":"aṇaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]},{"text":"பிணியும்","tr":"piṇiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிணி","tr":"piṇi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"அன்றே","tr":"aṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அன்","tr":"aṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"நுணங்கிக்","tr":"nuṇaṅkik","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நுணங்","tr":"nuṇaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கிக்","tr":"kik"}]}],[{"text":"கடுத்தலுந்","tr":"kaṭuttalun","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடுத்","tr":"kaṭut"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலுந்","tr":"talun"}]},{"text":"தணிதலும்","tr":"taṇitalum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தணி","tr":"taṇi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலும்","tr":"talum"}]},{"text":"இன்றே","tr":"iṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"யானை","tr":"yāṉai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"}]}],[{"text":"குளகுமென்","tr":"kuḷakumeṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குள","tr":"kuḷa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குமென்","tr":"kumeṉ"}]},{"text":"றாள்மதம்","tr":"ṟāḷmatam","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றாள்","tr":"ṟāḷ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மதம்","tr":"matam"}]},{"text":"போலப்","tr":"pōlap","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லப்","tr":"lap"}]}],[{"text":"பாணியும்","tr":"pāṇiyum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணியும்","tr":"ṇiyum"}]},{"text":"உடைத்தது","tr":"uṭaittatu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உடைத்","tr":"uṭait"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தது","tr":"tatu"}]},{"text":"காணுநர்ப்","tr":"kāṇunarp","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணுநர்ப்","tr":"ṇunarp"}]},{"text":"பெறினே","tr":"peṟiṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெறி","tr":"peṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"},{"surface":"என்ப","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"say"},{"text":"ப","lemma":"ப","gloss":"they"}],"gloss":"they say"},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அணங்கும்","parts":[{"text":"அணங்கு","lemma":"அணங்கு","gloss":"affliction"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"affliction also"},{"surface":"பிணியும்","parts":[{"text":"பிணி","lemma":"பிணி","gloss":"sickness"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"sickness also"},{"surface":"அன்றே","parts":[{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"அன்று","gloss":"it is not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"it is not indeed"},{"surface":"நுணங்கி","parts":[{"text":"நுணங்கு","lemma":"நுணங்கு","gloss":"become subtle"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having become subtle"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடுத்தலும்","parts":[{"text":"கடுத்தல்","lemma":"கடுத்தல்","gloss":"surging"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"surging also"},{"surface":"தணிதலும்","parts":[{"text":"தணிதல்","lemma":"தணிதல்","gloss":"subsiding"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"subsiding also"},{"surface":"இன்றே","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"இன்று","gloss":"without"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is not there indeed"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குளகு","parts":[{"text":"குளகு","lemma":"குளகு","gloss":"leafy shoots"}],"gloss":"leaves"},{"surface":"மென்றாள்","parts":[{"text":"மென்றாள்","lemma":"மென்றாள்","gloss":"because of chewing"}],"gloss":"because of chewing","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மதம்","parts":[{"text":"மதம்","lemma":"மதம்","gloss":"rut"}],"gloss":"rut"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பாணியும்","parts":[{"text":"பாணி","lemma":"பாணி","gloss":"delay/waiting"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"delay also"},{"surface":"உடைத்தது","parts":[{"text":"உடைத்து","lemma":"உடைத்து","gloss":"it possesses"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"euphonic"},{"text":"து","lemma":"து","gloss":"it"}],"gloss":"it possesses"},{"surface":"காணுநர்","parts":[{"text":"காண்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"see"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"present/future"},{"text":"நர்","lemma":"நர்","gloss":"they who"}],"gloss":"those who see"},{"surface":"பெறினே","parts":[{"text":"பெறின்","lemma":"பெறு","gloss":"if one finds"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"if found indeed"}]}],"literal":"Desire, desire, they say. Desire / is not just an affliction or a sickness. Becoming subtle, / it has no sudden surging or subsiding. Like the rut / of an elephant that chewed leafy shoots, / it also has a period of waiting, if only it finds those who can perceive it.","translation":"People talk of desire, of desire. But desire is not merely a tormenting spirit or a disease. It is subtle; it does not suddenly surge or subside. Like the rut of an elephant that has chewed leafy shoots, it has a period of quiet waiting, if only it finds those who can truly perceive it.","modern":"காமம் காமம் என்று எல்லாரும் சொல்கிறார்கள். காமம் என்பது வெறும் வருத்தமோ அல்லது நோயோ அல்ல. அது நுட்பமாகி, திடீரென மிகுவதோ அல்லது தணிவதோ இல்லாதது. தழைகளைத் தின்ற யானையின் மதநீர் போல, அதைப் புரிந்து கொள்பவர்களைப் பெற்றால், அது வெளிப்படாமல் அடங்கி இருக்கும் காலத்தையும் உடையது.","explanation":"The hero speaks to himself about the deep nature of his love for the heroine. People often speak of desire as if it were a simple affliction or a disease that comes and goes. But the hero explains that true love is subtle and deep; it does not have sudden, erratic surges or quick cures. He compares his love to the rut of an elephant that has fed on leafy shoots. Just as the elephant's rut remains hidden and builds up slowly within, only showing itself to those who know how to look, his love has a period of quiet waiting when there is someone who can truly understand and perceive it. The imagery of the mountain elephant feeding on forest leaves belongs to the Kurinji landscape, symbolizing the deep, enduring, and internal nature of their union.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.2],[1.2,1.3],[1.3,2.4],[2.4,2.8],[2.8,2.9],[3.2,3.82],[3.82,4.7],[4.7,5.2],[5.2,5.3],[5.3,6.0],[6.0,6.71],[6.71,7.19],[7.19,7.9],[7.9,8.9],[8.9,9.3],[9.3,9.8],[9.93,10.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.4],[1.4,1.5],[1.5,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.0,3.1],[3.1,4.46],[4.59,5.0],[5.0,5.5],[5.5,5.6],[5.6,6.4],[6.4,7.15],[7.15,7.65],[7.65,8.4],[8.4,9.5],[9.5,9.9],[9.9,10.5],[10.59,10.93]]},"sync":[[["காமம்","desire"]],[["காமம்","desire"]],[["என்ப","they say"]],[["காமம்","desire"]],[["அணங்கும்","affliction also"]],[["பிணியும்","sickness also"]],[["அன்றே","it is not indeed"]],[["நுணங்கி","having become subtle"]],[["கடுத்தலும்","surging also"]],[["தணிதலும்","subsiding also"]],[["இன்றே","is not there indeed"]],[["யானை","elephant"]],[["குளகு","leaves"],["மென்றாள்","because of chewing"]],[["மென்றாள்","because of chewing"],["மதம்","rut"]],[["போல","like"]],[["பாணியும்","delay also"]],[["உடைத்தது","it possesses"]],[["காணுநர்","those who see"],["பெறினே","if found indeed"]],[["பெறினே","if found indeed"]]]}